Description: PiCompose base system
 Docker with the PiCompose compose manager, the PipeWire audio setup for the
 Linux voice assistant and the hostname setup of the PiCompose image.
 .
 The compose manager deploys every Docker Compose project below /compose
 at boot and on a schedule. The package also adds the Docker apt repository,
 which has to be configured before the Docker packages can be installed.
